    ],
    "text": "NOTICE UNDER THE EXCHANGE CONTROL ACT (CHAPTER 423 OF THE CLE)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      145.29,
      347.53,
      442.41,
      358.6
    ],
    "text": "Permission in terms of Section 22(4) of the Exchange Control Act",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      369.49,
      538.75,
      391.6
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 44 of the Exchange Control Act, read with Section 22(3) and Section22(4) thereof, I, Ravi Karunanayake, Minister of Finance, do by this Order:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      74.61,
      402.49,
      538.77,
      413.56
    ],
    "text": "(i) repeal the exemption granted in respect of payment for goods exported from Sri Lanka in the Extraordinary",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      90.81,
      413.53,
      329.02,
      424.6
    ],
    "text": "Gazette Notification No. 759/15 dated 26th March 1993;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.61,
      435.49,
      538.78,
      446.56
    ],
    "text": "(ii) require repatriation of any such payment retained abroad as at the date of this order to Sri Lanka not later than",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      90.81,
      446.53,
      167.03,
      457.6
    ],
    "text": "1st May 2016; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.09,
      468.49,
      538.86,
      479.56
    ],
    "text": "(iii) require any such payment received on or after the date of this order to be repatriated to Sri Lanka within 90 days",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      90.81,
      479.53,
      248.62,
      490.6
    ],
